;
; How Verderer files its species tree in MYRA (verderer_rules.h VR6):
; under the kingdom (GBIF's kingdom key, 0 .. 8), the family, the genus
; and the species (GBIF keys), whether the species is protected (1) or
; not (0). Verderer asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps a
; species.
^ZXVERDERER(kingdom:i1, family:i9, genus:i9, species:i9) = protected:i1!
